sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as NexusSaga
    participant K as Kafka
    participant S1 as Inventory
    participant S2 as Payment
    participant S3 as Shipping
    Note over E,S3: Steps 1 and 2 already COMPLETED
    E->>K: shipping.create (attempt 1)
    K->>S3: FORWARD
    S3-->>E: FAILURE (HTTP 503)
    E->>K: shipping.create (attempt 2, retry)
    S3-->>E: FAILURE
    E->>K: shipping.create (attempt 3, retry)
    S3-->>E: FAILURE
    Note over E: maxRetries exhausted → COMPENSATING<br/>reverse traversal starts at step index 1
    E->>K: payment.refund (COMPENSATE step 2)
    K->>S2: COMPENSATE
    S2-->>E: SUCCESS
    E->>K: inventory.release (COMPENSATE step 1)
    K->>S1: COMPENSATE
    S1-->>E: SUCCESS
    Note over E: step 0 compensated → FAILED (fully rolled back)<br/>step 3 is never compensated (it never succeeded)
